WEBVTT

00:04:57.637 --> 00:05:00.033
and who was the pioneer
of the angiogenesis field,

00:05:00.057 --> 00:05:03.549
once called this "cancer without disease."

00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:07.430
So the body's ability
to balance angiogenesis,

00:05:07.454 --> 00:05:08.976
when it's working properly,

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:11.256
prevents blood vessels
from feeding cancers.

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:12.976
And this turns out to be

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:15.776
one of our most important
defense mechanisms

00:05:15.800 --> 00:05:17.029
against cancer.

00:05:18.212 --> 00:05:20.473
In fact, if you actually
block angiogenesis

00:05:20.497 --> 00:05:23.266
and prevent blood vessels
from ever reaching cancer cells,

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.691
tumors simply can't grow up.

00:05:24.715 --> 00:05:26.468
But once angiogenesis occurs,

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:28.675
cancers can grow exponentially.

00:05:29.389 --> 00:05:33.698
And this is actually how a cancer
goes from being harmless,